WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.892
"I tripped on a hole," said Cow.

2
00:00:09.893 --> 00:00:15.062
"Me too!" said Dog and Cat.

3
00:00:15.063 --> 00:00:19.157
"I fell over," said Pig.

4
00:00:19.158 --> 00:00:23.946
"Then I saw a hole."

5
00:00:23.947 --> 00:00:27.943
"Who made the holes?" asked Cat.

6
00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:30.877
"I don't know," said Cow.

7
00:00:30.878 --> 00:00:35.471
Bat came into the barn.

8
00:00:35.472 --> 00:00:42.183
Someone was with him.

9
00:00:42.184 --> 00:00:45.766
"This is my new friend," said Bat.

10
00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:49.681
"His name is Groundhog."

11
00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:55.399
"Did you make all the holes?" asked Dog.

12
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.251
"Yes," said Groundhog.

13
00:00:59.252 --> 00:01:03.593
"I was looking for food."

14
00:01:03.594 --> 00:01:06.822
Pig's belly made a sound.

15
00:01:06.823 --> 00:01:10.630
"Oh," said Pig.

16
00:01:10.631 --> 00:01:14.002
"Talking about food makes me hungry."

17
00:01:14.003 --> 00:01:16.823
Dog's belly made a sound.

18
00:01:16.824 --> 00:01:20.322
"Me too," said Dog.

19
00:01:20.323 --> 00:01:24.819
"I found lots of carrots," said Groundhog.

20
00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:27.008
"I'll go get them.

21
00:01:27.009 --> 00:01:39.414
Then we can have a feast!"

